# Build-time NLP cache (pickle): self-produced, regenerated on demand.
# Never commit it — a committed pickle is loaded at build time and would be a
# code-execution vector if a PR swapped it.
analytics_output/nlp_cache.pkl

# One-way feed fetched from gasyoun/IndologyArchiveAtlas (H460 split) by
# tools/fetch_indology_feed.py. Not duplicated here — CI re-fetches it every
# build; generate_renou_layer.py degrades gracefully if it's absent.
analytics_output/indology_feed/

# Personal review sheets (voting artifacts, not repo deliverables)
review/

# ---- Nagari Google Group archive (closed list: 2,333 real emails + private bodies) ----
# The raw Takeout dump (1.88 GB mbox + members.csv) and the built SQLite DB are
# NEVER committed. Only curated/derived outputs may be published, and only after
# a /publish-safety-check GO (third-party members joined a *closed* list).
nagari-2005-2026/
nagari/data/
# The retrospective page is the ONE published artifact: it embeds aggregate stats
# and thread subjects only, and carries no email addresses at all (verified by
# nagari/scripts/audit_publish_surface.py). Everything else under site/ stays out.
nagari/site/*
!nagari/site/index.html
# Rights-cleared public-domain attachments (bucket B of the H1142 census only:
# pre-1930 imprints, authors dead >=70y). Everything else under data/attachments/
# stays ignored; only this deliberately-selected PD subset is published.
!nagari/site/books/
!nagari/site/books/**
# The Markdown mirror (one file per thread, full message bodies) is published as
# of 17-07-2026: export_md.py now redacts the way page.py already did (H1104,
# verified 0 leaked addresses by scripts/audit_publish_surface.py), and MG ruled
# via chat to publish it so site links (notable threads / search results / files
# shared) resolve to real online files instead of dead text. Attachment BLOBS
# (the actual PDFs/DjVu etc.) stay a separate, still-open rights question -- only
# the pre-cleared subset under nagari/site/books/ is public.
!nagari/md/
nagari/**/__pycache__/

# ---- VK ORS wall archive (vk.com/wall-88831040, public page) ----
# The raw VK export (xlsx) and the built SQLite DB are regenerable build
# artifacts, not committed (unlike nagari, this is a public wall — no
# privacy gate, just repo hygiene: keep the ~21 MB DB and the xlsx out of
# git history). Only code + curated CSV/JSON layers under data/processed/
# and data/site_data.json are tracked.
vk-ors/vk_posts_all.xlsx
vk-ors/data/vk_ors.db
vk-ors/**/__pycache__/

# VK attachment metadata (regenerable via fetch.py; hotlink URLs rot)
vk-ors/data/attachments_raw.json

# ---- BVP public Google Groups archive ----
# Raw pages, crawl checkpoints, parsed message text, and failure ledgers are
# local acquisition assets. Only reviewed aggregate/quotation derivatives may
# later be promoted through an explicit publication gate.
bvp/data/
bvp/**/__pycache__/

